tr>⏎</table>⏎</td></tr>⏎</table>⏎</body>⏎</html>', '⏎', char(10)), '2026-10-29T11:34:48.921Z', '2026-10-29T11:34:48.921Z', 'Abandoned cart reminder', '[]', '00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, 0);
